WEBVTT

00:07.170 --> 00:08.910
Good work.

00:08.910 --> 00:11.960
Keeping you on the team was the right choice.

00:13.120 --> 00:14.360
What about "it"?

00:14.730 --> 00:16.400
It's ready.

00:16.920 --> 00:22.020
But boarding the <i>Archimedes</i> will 
require you to forfeit the match.

00:22.430 --> 00:23.530
That's fine.

00:23.920 --> 00:26.750
Once it's mine, I have no more 
business with you people.

00:27.010 --> 00:29.590
What do you want?

00:30.480 --> 00:34.010
To destroy everything. That's all.

00:34.720 --> 00:38.140
Including you and Jue Viole Grace.

02:17.990 --> 02:21.990
<b>Episode 24</b>

02:17.990 --> 02:21.990
<b>The Cost of Battle</b>

02:22.660 --> 02:25.650
I'm glad you're back, black turtle!

02:25.650 --> 02:26.750
Rak!

02:26.980 --> 02:29.330
Welcome back, you jerk!

02:30.300 --> 02:32.640
The three of us are back together again!

02:37.080 --> 02:38.310
Those guys...

02:38.970 --> 02:42.640
So the ultimate team is back together.

02:42.640 --> 02:44.680
We'll have to do some serious work now.

02:44.680 --> 02:47.500
You're my prey, you got that?

02:47.500 --> 02:49.730
Don't ever run away again!

02:51.260 --> 02:53.760
All that's left is to defeat FUG!

02:53.760 --> 02:56.690
Follow me, everyone!

02:57.550 --> 02:59.530
What are you staring at?

03:01.010 --> 03:02.220
Nothing.

03:03.660 --> 03:08.520
Just realizing for the first time that 
he can make a face like that, too.

03:03.790 --> 03:05.630
You grew out your hair.

03:05.630 --> 03:08.150
You're the long black turtle now.

03:11.690 --> 03:12.880
Akraptor.

03:12.880 --> 03:16.380
Hey, Viole. I'm glad you made it back.

03:16.960 --> 03:19.470
Thanks to all of you.

03:19.470 --> 03:21.770
We didn't do anything.

03:22.170 --> 03:23.610
Anyway, where's Horyang?

03:23.610 --> 03:25.950
He's still in the final arena.

03:26.960 --> 03:29.730
I'm sorry. I came here alone.

03:29.730 --> 03:32.130
Don't worry too much.

03:32.130 --> 03:33.810
He'll make it out just fine.

03:34.750 --> 03:36.730
How's Wangnan?

03:37.470 --> 03:40.310
Thankfully, there was a treatment 
facility on the floating ship,

03:40.310 --> 03:41.770
so he should pull through.

03:42.210 --> 03:45.120
That Lero Ro guy is taking care of him.

03:45.430 --> 03:48.220
It's a miracle he's alive with that injury,

03:48.690 --> 03:56.180
but I'm really glad we won't have 
to regret letting him live.

03:58.360 --> 03:59.450
Sophia.

04:01.060 --> 04:03.130
Is Beta all right?

04:03.430 --> 04:04.820
Barely.

04:04.820 --> 04:08.390
But now that the order's been 
given to dispose of him...

04:09.750 --> 04:14.550
This boy wouldn't have been so 
unhappy if I'd been stronger.

04:15.120 --> 04:17.020
I disagree.

04:18.010 --> 04:24.660
I don't think Cassano, Horyang, and 
Beta were necessarily only unhappy.

04:25.530 --> 04:29.740
Since we're at a shop,
why don't you buy a new spear?

04:29.740 --> 04:31.210
You gonna buy me one?

04:31.210 --> 04:33.950
Well, I've got plenty of points...

04:34.670 --> 04:37.100
What are you still worried about?

04:38.240 --> 04:42.560
We're still in the tournament,
and Bam's back.

04:42.560 --> 04:45.050
The true climax is still to come.

04:45.050 --> 04:50.340
Setting aside the tournament, there are 
FUG Rankers waiting for us on that ship.

04:50.850 --> 04:54.110
We've made an enemy of the Workshop, too.

04:54.110 --> 04:56.810
We don't have a way to get out of here.

04:57.340 --> 04:59.600
Also, what's gonna happen 
with the tournament?

04:59.600 --> 05:02.960
I wonder why the hosts suddenly 
went inside the <i>Archimedes</i>.

05:03.720 --> 05:06.820
The tournament will probably 
be put on hold for a while.

05:07.200 --> 05:08.630
Ro.

05:10.010 --> 05:11.830
What do you mean?

05:12.510 --> 05:15.580
There seems to be trouble above.

05:16.500 --> 05:17.580
What?!

05:17.580 --> 05:20.710
The door to Emily's hangar was destroyed?!

05:20.710 --> 05:24.520
Yeah. If any of the fugitives approach Emily...

05:24.520 --> 05:26.950
We have to stop that from 
happening, no matter what!

05:26.950 --> 05:29.350
Without the audience noticing!

05:29.570 --> 05:32.270
The game is on hold.

05:32.270 --> 05:35.390
At this rate, the real one 
might be allowed to escape.

05:36.130 --> 05:41.360
My allies should be arriving in the 
participant waiting room shortly.

05:41.360 --> 05:44.860
Huh? Allies? What are they 
doing in the waiting room?

05:45.240 --> 05:47.880
We're going to use the summoning system

05:47.880 --> 05:51.870
in the waiting room to 
bring your allies here.

05:52.340 --> 05:58.710
We'll connect the portal in the waiting 
room to the portal on the ship I rode here

05:58.710 --> 06:01.130
to hijack them.

06:01.130 --> 06:04.170
By the way, your allies who 
dropped out of the tournament

06:04.170 --> 06:06.380
are already aboard the floating ship.

06:06.380 --> 06:07.020
Huh?

06:09.430 --> 06:11.390
<i>We have an announcement.</i>

06:11.860 --> 06:15.770
<i>We've received word that fugitives 
have snuck aboard the ship.</i>

06:15.770 --> 06:19.770
<i>For your safety, please evacuate 
to the nearby building.</i>

06:19.770 --> 06:21.770
<i>The final is postponed.</i>

06:21.770 --> 06:24.150
<i>We'll notify you of the 
new time at a later date.</i>

06:24.380 --> 06:28.400
<i>I didn't expect them to try 
to escape during the match.</i>

06:28.400 --> 06:33.680
<i>We can't avoid the loss,
but we should probably act, as well.</i>

06:34.550 --> 06:38.610
Mr. Madoraco, we've received 
a message from the arena.

06:39.030 --> 06:40.100
A message?

06:41.070 --> 06:44.310
What?! We're going to 
escape before the final?

06:44.620 --> 06:50.800
Yes. Now that we've rescued Bam, 
there's no reason to stay any longer.

06:51.290 --> 06:53.800
But where are we going to go?

06:54.270 --> 07:00.060
There's a Wolhaiksong floating 
ship waiting not far from here.

07:00.060 --> 07:02.140
Wolhaiksong?

07:02.520 --> 07:04.820
How'd you get those shady guys to help us?

07:04.820 --> 07:09.520
Bam, you met Urek Mazino 
a few years ago, didn't you?

07:09.520 --> 07:10.320
Yes.

07:10.320 --> 07:12.600
What?! Seriously?

07:12.600 --> 07:15.680
You mean the Tower's strongest man,
<i>that</i> Urek Mazino?

07:16.300 --> 07:22.080
Yes. He's currently the 
highest-ranked active Ranker.

07:22.870 --> 07:26.590
Powerful enough to take 
on the Ten Families alone,

07:26.880 --> 07:29.840
he's one of the founding 
members of Wolhaiksong.

07:30.560 --> 07:34.710
And like you, he's an Irregular.

07:35.360 --> 07:38.860
He's interested in you and wants to meet you.

07:39.850 --> 07:43.100
That's also the reason I came here.

07:43.600 --> 07:46.560
But the others...

07:49.370 --> 07:52.270
Hwaryun! Did you escape?

07:52.270 --> 07:58.620
<i>You managed to escape quite easily,
Jue Viole Grace.</i>

07:59.170 --> 08:00.750
Reflejo...

08:01.050 --> 08:06.360
But in your haste, you left your Guide behind.

08:07.080 --> 08:10.380
Reflejo! What did you do to Hwaryun?

08:10.380 --> 08:14.200
I simply gave her a little special attention.

08:14.200 --> 08:18.140
But if you don't come to save them,

08:18.140 --> 08:24.390
the three you left behind will suffer 
unimaginably before they die.

08:27.510 --> 08:31.170
<i>Now, let the final begin.</i>

08:31.900 --> 08:38.620
If you successfully rescue your three allies 
from three different locations, you win.

08:39.120 --> 08:44.160
If I lose, I will gracefully forfeit the match.

08:44.840 --> 08:51.130
<i>I will be waiting for you where 
the Thorn was, Jue Viole Grace.</i>

08:52.850 --> 08:55.550
Will Viole really come?

08:56.050 --> 08:57.050
He will.

08:57.540 --> 09:04.290
He's chosen the path of a Slayer Candidate 
for seven years to protect his friends.

09:04.290 --> 09:06.100
There's no way he won't come.

09:07.620 --> 09:09.060
I'm going to save them.

09:09.060 --> 09:12.970
Wait. There's no doubt that this is a trap.

09:12.970 --> 09:14.700
If you go there...

09:15.100 --> 09:16.670
I'm going anyway.

09:16.670 --> 09:20.280
This is a problem I have to fix.

09:20.280 --> 09:24.030
But Bam, you might not 
make it back this time.

09:24.030 --> 09:26.320
That's fine. I'm still going.

09:26.320 --> 09:27.470
But...

09:28.840 --> 09:31.320
You haven't changed a bit.

09:31.660 --> 09:35.550
Okay. The three of us 
will go rescue Hwaryun.

09:35.550 --> 09:38.070
You guys save the other two.

09:38.070 --> 09:39.050
Khun?

09:39.050 --> 09:42.220
Ro, how long can you wait?

09:42.220 --> 09:46.350
I can't guarantee it,
but probably about 30 minutes.

09:46.350 --> 09:48.180
That's barely enough time.

09:48.970 --> 09:54.750
If we're not back in 30 minutes,
take everyone who's here and go.

09:54.750 --> 09:56.070
Khun!

09:56.650 --> 09:58.290
This works out great.

09:58.290 --> 10:02.820
Let's take care of FUG 
and win before we escape.

10:02.820 --> 10:05.620
Khun, I'm doing this alone.

10:05.620 --> 10:09.000
I finally got to see you again. 
I'm not letting you go alone.

10:09.000 --> 10:10.320
But there's no time.

10:10.320 --> 10:13.840
It's okay. If Shibisu is still 
here because of an error,

10:13.840 --> 10:16.150
then she should show up soon, too.

10:18.860 --> 10:19.780
She's here.

10:21.000 --> 10:25.570
I told you to summon me right away,
but you were taking forever.

10:36.850 --> 10:39.070
You're all useless.

10:39.720 --> 10:42.590
My makeup came off because of you.

10:43.080 --> 10:46.430
You finally summoned me, and now what?

10:46.430 --> 10:49.830
What is this dreadful situation?

10:50.120 --> 10:52.460
Oh! Princess?

10:54.460 --> 10:57.820
Honestly, when are we 
going to go on our date?

11:09.340 --> 11:12.850
What? The final? What's going on?

11:13.090 --> 11:16.320
You said we'd get out of 
here before the final!

11:16.320 --> 11:19.320
Hey, Ro! Are you stupid?

11:20.760 --> 11:24.330
Hey, mister. When are we getting out of here?

11:24.330 --> 11:26.280
You're scaring me.

11:26.560 --> 11:30.130
Hey, scumbag! You tricked us, didn't you?

11:30.130 --> 11:31.970
Oh, shut up! Keep your mouth shut!

11:31.970 --> 11:34.170
What was that, scumbag?!

11:34.500 --> 11:39.630
Damn it! Why did I follow him here?

11:40.720 --> 11:44.260
Get me out of here!

11:45.600 --> 11:47.010
Thirty minutes?

11:47.310 --> 11:49.520
Yes, please.

11:49.840 --> 11:54.170
Fine, but any longer and 
we'll catch their attention.

11:54.170 --> 11:57.270
We're transporting at exactly 30 minutes.

11:57.980 --> 11:59.140
Understood.

11:59.480 --> 12:00.490
Um, excuse me...

12:01.280 --> 12:04.780
Please take Beta with you.

12:05.150 --> 12:05.830
Huh?

12:06.170 --> 12:10.290
He'll just be disposed of if 
he returns to the Workshop.

12:11.070 --> 12:15.040
I want him to live freely,
even if it's just for a short while.

12:15.490 --> 12:17.970
But without his medicine...

12:17.970 --> 12:20.800
The medicine should last him for a month.

12:21.710 --> 12:25.800
Like him, I'm an illegitimate 
child from the Middle Area.

12:25.800 --> 12:28.560
I was fortunate that I became 
a Workshop researcher.

12:29.500 --> 12:32.960
Since becoming a researcher, 
I've wondered if I can do anything for kids

12:32.960 --> 12:34.810
who grew up under the same circumstances.

12:35.420 --> 12:37.620
That's why I participated in that experiment.

12:38.230 --> 12:42.730
If it succeeded and all the abandoned 
illegitimate children became stronger,

12:42.730 --> 12:44.820
no one would be able to hurt them.

12:45.770 --> 12:48.450
When I saw the children who 
returned to the Workshop stronger,

12:48.450 --> 12:52.060
I thought I had been right, but...

12:52.560 --> 12:54.210
I disagree.

12:55.980 --> 12:56.980
Horyang...

12:56.980 --> 13:01.400
No, Ilmar kept thinking 
of the name you gave him

13:01.400 --> 13:06.840
to endure the terrible pain he 
suffered during the experiments.

13:07.620 --> 13:12.160
It's what kept him from losing himself.

13:12.520 --> 13:14.060
That was enough for them to be happy.

13:15.040 --> 13:22.270
I had no idea what those 
children needed to be happy.

13:24.020 --> 13:25.190
Please.

13:25.190 --> 13:30.820
This boy, Ilmar, Cassano, 
and that boy named Viole...

13:31.170 --> 13:37.750
Please help them all escape
so they can find some happiness.

13:38.950 --> 13:43.320
Very well. I'll do what I can.

13:43.780 --> 13:47.370
Beniamino Cassano...

13:49.450 --> 13:50.770
It's him.

13:51.120 --> 13:52.180
Beta?

13:52.610 --> 13:56.120
He's the one who was controlling everything.

13:56.480 --> 13:58.680
But why?

13:59.520 --> 14:02.940
Why did he save me from that place?

14:08.580 --> 14:10.230
Why?

14:12.360 --> 14:15.770
What are you doing here, princess?

14:16.200 --> 14:17.210
Where's Viole?

14:17.210 --> 14:22.960
Could you not casually drop my 
boyfriend's name? It's annoying.

14:22.960 --> 14:26.090
What? No way! You have a boyfriend?

14:26.390 --> 14:28.460
It just kind of happened.

14:28.460 --> 14:30.690
We're supposed to go on a date now.

14:30.690 --> 14:32.600
Sorry, but could you get out of here?

14:32.600 --> 14:35.740
A Princess of Jahad going on a date?

14:35.740 --> 14:38.270
Won't you be killed if you're found out?

14:38.270 --> 14:40.350
Just like Anaak's mommy.

14:42.010 --> 14:42.980
Endorsi!

14:47.700 --> 14:50.350
Ugh, what? Is this your bodyguard?

14:54.350 --> 14:58.400
You're in quite the hurry 
to die, Princess of Jahad.

15:02.000 --> 15:04.170
Hwaryun! Hwaryun!

15:04.170 --> 15:06.040
She's alive.

15:08.110 --> 15:10.180
Just barely.

15:11.750 --> 15:15.680
I knew you would come, Viole.

15:16.110 --> 15:18.980
What's with that guy? His body...

15:19.680 --> 15:22.700
Some kind of smoke is coming out of him.

15:23.130 --> 15:25.690
So he was hiding his strength.

15:26.160 --> 15:30.820
If you wanted to lure me here,
you didn't need to do all this!

15:31.040 --> 15:34.370
You must be disciplined harshly.

15:34.370 --> 15:38.830
But perhaps I did go too far this time.

15:38.830 --> 15:41.370
You meant to kill her from the start!

15:43.250 --> 15:46.630
Shall we begin the finale?

15:51.320 --> 15:54.640
<i>He damaged Endorsi without touching her?</i>

16:19.330 --> 16:22.870
What's his problem? My clothes are ruined.

16:23.200 --> 16:26.870
Varagarv is the strongest 
E-Rank Fighting Dog,

16:26.870 --> 16:29.370
combining the blood of multiple families.

16:29.370 --> 16:31.630
You think you can beat us?

16:31.630 --> 16:34.910
You're challenging me to a fight?

16:34.910 --> 16:37.770
You must be out of your mind.

16:38.920 --> 16:41.320
Horyang! Where are you?

16:42.000 --> 16:43.770
Horyang!

16:43.770 --> 16:45.600
Hurry up!

16:45.600 --> 16:47.520
Do you want Goseng to be all alone?

16:47.520 --> 16:49.430
Give me a break!

16:49.430 --> 16:51.850
I'm not a member of the Ten Families, okay?

16:54.400 --> 16:55.320
Hey.

16:55.760 --> 16:57.590
Did you find anyone, weirdo?

16:57.590 --> 16:58.800
Nope, nobody.

16:58.800 --> 17:02.410
Oh, come on! Where are you, Horyang?!

17:04.770 --> 17:07.790
You're no ordinary E-Rank Regular, are you?

17:07.790 --> 17:12.510
Correct. I am one of Poken's shadows.

17:13.220 --> 17:14.300
Poken?

17:14.780 --> 17:20.220
If I so desire, I can exert 
power greater than a B-Rank.

17:20.220 --> 17:21.970
That's impossible!

17:21.970 --> 17:24.210
Give up.

17:24.210 --> 17:27.730
In your current state, you cannot beat me.

17:27.730 --> 17:29.220
No!

17:29.220 --> 17:32.650
I don't want to give up on myself anymore!

17:32.890 --> 17:35.870
Then you leave me with no choice.

17:37.280 --> 17:38.330
Bam!

17:38.330 --> 17:39.410
I know.

17:40.780 --> 17:44.750
Damn smoke turtle!

17:53.730 --> 17:57.050
He didn't even flinch. But...

17:59.800 --> 18:02.810
We're taking Hwaryun back!

18:08.810 --> 18:12.730
We got good information out of that man.

18:12.730 --> 18:16.570
Was it all right for him to take that?

18:16.570 --> 18:21.050
It's fine. Deals must always be fair.

18:21.050 --> 18:24.960
There's no need for us to 
continue dealing with a fool

18:24.960 --> 18:27.710
who left his party out of fear.

18:28.530 --> 18:30.620
Prepare the solution.

18:30.620 --> 18:34.160
The time has come to end the Workshop Battle.

18:34.840 --> 18:38.080
No! Let me see Emily!

18:38.080 --> 18:39.090
Shut up!

18:39.090 --> 18:41.330
<i>I won't be able to get in through here.</i>

18:39.090 --> 18:41.930
She tricked me!

18:41.330 --> 18:42.670
<i>Is there some other way in?</i>

18:41.930 --> 18:43.470
You're not making any sense!

18:47.510 --> 18:48.560
It's so tight...

18:49.580 --> 18:52.290
<i>Why did Emily fool us?</i>

18:52.600 --> 18:54.920
<i>Why did she gather us here?</i>

18:55.480 --> 18:57.770
<i>I won't give up until I find out...</i>

18:59.110 --> 19:00.720
<i>who or what you really are.</i>

19:04.820 --> 19:06.740
<i>It should be up ahead.</i>

19:11.050 --> 19:11.920
A person?

19:16.940 --> 19:21.010
What's wrong? Aren't you going to attack?

19:21.350 --> 19:22.890
The hostage...

19:24.470 --> 19:27.600
<i>I need to immobilize him and save Hwaryun!</i>

19:31.610 --> 19:33.350
That won't work.

19:33.350 --> 19:38.370
Didn't I say you don't 
stand a chance against me?

19:38.740 --> 19:39.890
How?

19:39.890 --> 19:42.360
Does that unsettle you?

19:42.790 --> 19:47.240
I was made to fight you.

19:47.770 --> 19:52.370
Naturally, I know everything 
you're capable of.

19:53.820 --> 20:01.310
I've lived over a thousand 
years for that one purpose.

20:01.310 --> 20:05.070
To fulfill Poken's greatest wish.

20:05.540 --> 20:08.540
This unparalleled joy rising up inside me...

20:10.010 --> 20:14.900
To think this historic 
moment should arrive now!

20:15.200 --> 20:17.680
He's obsessed.

20:17.680 --> 20:19.650
A real pervert.

20:19.880 --> 20:23.030
It's time to end this.

20:26.390 --> 20:28.000
Five baang.

20:28.000 --> 20:30.160
My Lighthouse is at its limit.

20:30.160 --> 20:32.040
You'll have to intercept all of them.

20:37.680 --> 20:39.210
You fell for it.

20:43.650 --> 20:46.590
His Shinsu merged into one baang?

20:51.000 --> 20:54.260
You were my targets from the start!

20:54.650 --> 20:55.600
<i>Wait...</i>

20:56.020 --> 20:57.430
<i>He's aiming for them?!</i>

20:58.550 --> 20:59.880
Begone.

21:02.430 --> 21:03.140
Bam!

21:03.140 --> 21:04.240
Black turtle!

21:07.320 --> 21:09.740
It's all right. I can handle this.

21:09.740 --> 21:13.750
If I attack while he's unleashing his Shinsu...

21:13.970 --> 21:16.470
You can't do it.

21:16.470 --> 21:21.750
The weakness that made you want 
to save everyone brought you here,

21:21.750 --> 21:25.010
and it will be what kills all of you.

21:28.010 --> 21:32.550
Damn that cowardly smoke turtle!

21:32.550 --> 21:34.390
I'll kill him!

21:34.390 --> 21:38.020
Don't, Rak! He's got a hostage!

21:39.120 --> 21:42.720
<i>I hate to admit it, but he's more 
calculating than I expected.</i>

21:42.720 --> 21:47.780
<i>He's trying to use us to ensure his victory.</i>

21:47.780 --> 21:49.990
<i>He's taken a hostage, too.</i>

21:51.250 --> 21:52.650
<i>But wait.</i>

21:53.330 --> 21:55.790
<i>Maybe that hostage is actually...</i>

21:56.230 --> 21:57.060
Rak!

21:57.060 --> 21:58.040
Huh?

21:58.500 --> 22:03.450
I've figured out how we can 
take down that smoky bastard.

23:36.660 --> 23:39.330
I don't know how to use this, but...

23:38.990 --> 23:41.250
<b>Next Time
Return of the King</b>
